faqsText:
Is Sector S part of Faisal Town Phase 2? | Yes. Sector S is part of Faisal Town Phase 2 / FT-II.

Can I download the Sector S plan? | Yes. A dedicated Sector S FT-II plan is available on this page.

What plot sizes are available in Sector S? | Current Sector S material lists 5.56, 8, 10.89 and 14.22 marla plots as well as 1 kanal. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}

What is the price of a 5.56-marla plot in Sector S? | Current Sector S-focused pricing lists a total around PKR 3.495 million before any applicable discount or updated charges. Confirm the live payable amount before booking. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

What is the price of an 8-marla plot in Sector S? | Current Sector S-focused pricing lists approximately PKR 4.665 million. Current availability and payment terms should be reconfirmed before payment. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}

Is Sector S available on installments? | Current project-focused material publishes an installment structure, but the exact Sector S schedule should be verified with the current sales documentation before booking. :contentReference[oaicite:4]{index=4}

Is there a lump-sum discount in Sector S? | Current Sector S material refers to a 20% lump-sum discount, but buyers should confirm that the offer still applies to the exact current inventory. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}

Are development charges included? | Do not assume this without written current confirmation for the exact Sector S offer. Ask for a full payable breakdown before booking.

Should I compare Sector S with Sector T? | Yes. Compare the same plot size, location, payment structure, development and total payable amount.

Should I visit Sector S before booking? | Yes. A site visit or trusted live video inspection is recommended so the sector plan can be compared with actual conditions.
